# Worg Carrier from Kibler's Exotic Pets (Lower Blackrock Spire).
# Sources: quests.json (Kibler's quest, level 55); the world database (the
# reward, item 12264; the pups, NPC 10221, are Halycon's); the knowledge
# base's quest notes (the pups in Halycon's lair in Lower Blackrock Spire, the
# cage cast); Lower Blackrock Spire (55-60) is in Forever.

step Kibler at Flame Crest
  tip Kibler stands inside the cave at Flame Crest, the camp in northern Burning Steppes east of Blackrock Mountain. He gives you an Empty Worg Pup Cage. He also gives En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (the Smolderweb Carrier): take both, they are done in the same run.
  accept 4729

step Lower Blackrock Spire: Halycon's pups
  tip The pups are in Lower Blackrock Spire (a group of five, level 55-60), not Upper: they run with Halycon, the great worg, deep in the dungeon beyond Urok Doomhowl's ogres. Use the cage on a living Bloodaxe Worg Pup before the pack is dead. Taking damage interrupts the cast, so let the tank hold the pups and cage one from the side. A rogue or druid can sneak in, cage a pup from a corner, then vanish.
  collect 12263 quest 4729 @33.2,24.9 -- Lower Blackrock Spire

step Back to Kibler
  turnin 4729
  collect 12264 @65.9,21.9            -- Worg Carrier
